f8a\" title=\"56-thm-homomorphism-evaluation\">56-thm-homomorphism-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.12(ii)–7.1.13"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263–264"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span><span>285</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read; finite-representative-derivation-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f90a5c149724deb\" href=\"?note=6f90a5c149724deb\" title=\"56-df-term-model\">56-df-term-model</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,E,T,Q,G,Q_G,I_T,I_G\">\\(\\Sigma,V,E,T,Q,G,Q_G,I_T,I_G\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(T/Q,I_Q)\">\\(\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(T/Q,I_Q)\\)</span>；仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(G\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 时记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})\">\\(\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>；商投影、替换解释及同态解释交换式见本文件直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(T/Q,I_Q,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(T/Q,I_Q,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q},E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q},E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已读 Proposition 7.1.13 及其证明（跨pp263–264）。给定(s,t)∈E与商载体赋值，只需为Var(s)∪Var(t)中有限多个变量取代表；开放项情形在其他变量处取恒等，基项情形在其他变量处取某个固定基项。得到σ后，商投影同态与项解释交换式给出s、t的解释分别为[sσ]、[tσ]。Q对替换封闭且含E，故两类相同。基项情形同理且σ的值都在G；无全局代表选择的隐藏要求。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.12(ii)–7.1.13，印刷页 263–264。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f90a5c149724deb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined","status":"resolved","id":"ee77de74c708cdc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-substitution-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"360c9afc4431285e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-substitution-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-homomorphism-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"711a8fd18e306f8a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-homomorphism-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o